  "equipment_type": "Thermostat (fan coil)",
  "applies_to": "Johnson Controls T7000 series Modbus thermostats listed in the data table: T7600-TF21, T7601-TF20 (ECM fan), T7600-TF20 (relay), T7603-T000 (single-stage heating) and T7600-TB21 (with AI); data table revision 2.4 (2019-12-23).",
  "summary": "The T7000 is a Johnson Controls room thermostat family for 2- and 4-pipe fan coil units (plus floor-heating, TiO2/ESP and single-stage heating variants) with a Modbus RTU port. Relays read as coils, live values as input registers, and power, mode, setpoint, fan speed and all settings as holding registers. Temperatures are stored as tenths of a degree.",
